  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/JmybsfWs/images/6e64e31a8abb63137d86859b3a5fc417a18e6889.png\" alt=\"LOGO\"></p>\n<h2><strong>概览</strong></h2>\n<hr>\n<h4>Create: Dreams &amp; Desires 是一款为 Create 模组打造的附加模组，添加了与旧版及新版 Create 相关的各类生活便利性（QoL）、物品与方块功能！</h4>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/JmybsfWs/images/174d0d55937391091adcf7bf9f4d835f146398f4.png\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/JmybsfWs/images/174d0d55937391091adcf7bf9f4d835f146398f4.png\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/JmybsfWs/images/43693c621633e855b49fe07f6252c6363603acd5.png\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/JmybsfWs/images/43693c621633e855b49fe07f6252c6363603acd5.png\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/JmybsfWs/images/92a7ca6939ac4acddfca6093ce303514849b40df.png\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/JmybsfWs/images/92a7ca6939ac4acddfca6093ce303514849b40df.png\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/JmybsfWs/images/c7318d4aea92b250b5a4a3c60a7194b0749875eb.png\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/JmybsfWs/images/c7318d4aea92b250b5a4a3c60a7194b0749875eb.png\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/JmybsfWs/images/acb8002560c889c31fb4c6f765d9b2e63cb5dd9e.png\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/JmybsfWs/images/acb8002560c889c31fb4c6f765d9b2e63cb5dd9e.png\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLuna\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/812868981806465075/1228619170615263283/image.png?ex=662cb3c4&is=661a3ec4&hm=0b533f867374aaaa365fd49bd3b1ccde55680fb7f8a01975b7bfd6bf133c4a8a&=&format=webp&quality=lossless\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<p>由社区维护的 Fabric 版 GitHub 仓库 &amp; 我也建议在此处及 Discord 中反馈问题\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcodeberg.org%252fSappho%252fcreate_dd_fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://codeberg.org/Sappho/create_dd_fabric</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/UHTbHcdkGx\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/812868981806465075/1228619341755318293/disord.png?ex=66601e6d&is=665ecced&hm=3831efc9b691572fa2f50cd23a35d42d44d11e0a11d025277eac02b80f06cb4b&\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
